{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a multimodal model combining RNA data (PCA-reduced) and image data (ResNet50 features) via simple concatenation fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest baseline performance for this configuration. Uncertainty remains about the relative contribution of modality-specific features versus fusion strategy, as no comparative benchmarks exist yet."
}

